{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWireframe","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"This Wireframe theme is a theme for some specific usages, like for prototyping and design of journeys with non-Orange charted themes.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemeswireframe"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["🧬 Theme version: 2.5.0"],"syntax":null},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wireframe theme uses the Shantell Sans font family"}]}],"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Wireframe theme does not embed charts colors yet, and is read only: it cannot be suclassed or derivated."}]}],"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important"},{"level":2,"text":"How to use the theme","type":"heading","anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/WireframeTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" directly. To use the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/WireframeTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" without further modifications, you will have to use the "},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for your root view and give it an instance of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/documentation\/OUDSThemesWireframe\/WireframeTheme","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Keep in mind the themes are "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift class objects"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and can be h